% Fixture for the gmat_validate_script error path. The Spacecraft below
% carries a deliberately unknown field name (WidgetCount). GMAT's
% interpreter rejects the load and emits an ERROR / Interpreter
% Exception line tagged with the offending source line.
% (All comments are ASCII so the non-ASCII guard does not fire first.)

Create Spacecraft Sat
Sat.WidgetCount = 7

BeginMissionSequence
